290	const ELI5_RULES = `Audience: Korean players aged 15-20 (ELI5 "Age 15" + "Senior High/College" styles).
291	- Casual but not cringey, no "fellow kids" energy. Use "-요" polite casual Korean.
292	- Analogies from games, phones, social media, school life.
